The document [1605] states: "Rachel Dunn — 2003-2005 — Perry moved on with professional volleyball player Rachel Dunn in 2003. The athlete made several public appearances with the Emmy nominee and was dating him when 'Friends' came to an end." This directly identifies an actor (Matthew Perry, the "Friends" star) whose girlfriend was a professional volleyball player, with the relationship occurring in 2003–2005 — well before December 31, 2023.

Explanation: The evidence explicitly identifies actor Matthew Perry's girlfriend Rachel Dunn as a professional volleyball player. The document, a dating-history retrospective on Perry published October 30, 2023, states that Perry "moved on with professional volleyball player Rachel Dunn in 2003" and that she "was dating him when 'Friends' came to an end" — i.e., their relationship occurred in 2003–2005, prior to December 31, 2023 [1605]. This satisfies both conditions: the person is an actor (Matthew Perry of "Friends") and his girlfriend was a volleyball player before the cutoff date [1605].
Exact Answer: Matthew Perry
Confidence: 90%

