e an impression that if it was not the case of Leon, one of the best \u2013 if not the best \u2013 players in the world, no one would make a fuss about it. In the meantime, there is a really good player, who WANTS TO play for a really strong team, and suddenly people have problem with that, even though it is NOTHING new is sports. Maybe the regulations should"
