st child, baby Martina, just this month, exactly nine months after actress Sheena Halili and non-showbiz boyfriend and lawyer Jeron Manzanero tied the knot in a beautiful Christian ceremony on Feb. 23.\n\nSheena and Jeron got married at The Blue Leaf Events Place in Que"
